  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF preview.35 with immutable ProGPU preview.39; fixes X11 transparent visuals, nonactivating native maps, and transient popup placement; ships bounded weak render-resource caches, retained-scene disposal, static-frame render suppression, and typed memory ownership diagnostics; consumes the reflection-free media drawing-state bridge; and retains the Windows OLE clipboard and cross-platform input, popup, theme, WPFGallery, and designer gates.",
